{"words": [{"text": "هَلْ", "translation": "Are"}, {"text": "يَنظُرُونَ", "translation": "they waiting"}, {"text": "إِلَّآ", "translation": "[except]"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "يَأْتِيَهُمُ", "translation": "comes to them"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ظُلَلٍۢ", "translation": "(the) shadows"}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱلْغَمَامِ", "translation": "[the] clouds"}, {"text": "وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ", "translation": "and the Angels"}, {"text": "وَقُضِىَ", "translation": "and is decreed"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَمْرُ ۚ", "translation": "the matter"}, {"text": "وَإِلَى", "translation": "And to"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "تُرْجَعُ", "translation": "return"}, {"text": "ٱلْأُمُورُ", "translation": "(all) the matters"}], "sahih": "Do they await but that Allāh should come to them in covers of clouds and the angels [as well] and the matter is [then] decided? And to Allāh [all] matters are returned."}